# Kaggle v13 Output lands here. The five checkpoints are 332 MB each -- 1.6 GB total --
# and must never reach git.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers *.pth, *.pth.tar and *.ckpt. These add the two cases
# it does not: Kaggle serves an Output download as a .zip, and a torch checkpoint IS a zip
# container, so double-clicking one gets it unpacked by macOS Archive Utility into a
# directory of raw tensor shards (data/0, data/1, ...) -- one checkpoint becomes ~240 files.
*.zip
*/

# The small artifacts ARE worth keeping: they are the run's record.
!README.md
!*.csv
!*.png
!*.txt
!*.json
